messages.content:
80 portundaki server bloğunda:

```nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name ornek.com;
    return 301 https://$host$request_uri;
}
```

`nginx -t` ile doğrula, `systemctl reload nginx` ile uygula.

```nginx
limit_req_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=api:10m rate=10r/s;
location /api/ { limit_req zone=api burst=20 nodelay; }
```
Login gibi uçlarda daha sıkı zone kullan.

```nginx
ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
ssl_ciphers ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256;
add_header Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains" always;
```
`nginx -t && systemctl reload nginx`. HSTS öncesi tüm alt alanlar HTTPS olmalı.
